==Spanish==

===Pronunciation===
{{es-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|es|i}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|es|la|sic|sīc}}, probably through a compound {{m|la|ad}} {{m|la|sīc}}. Cognates include {{m|es|sí||yes}}. Compare {{cog|pt|assim}}, {{cog|ca|així}}, {{cog|fr|ainsi}}, {{cog|it|così}}, {{cog|ro|așa}}.

====Adverb====
{{es-adv}}

# like this; like that; as such; [[thus]]; [[so]]; [[thereby]]; [[this way]], [[that way]]
#: {{uxi|es|¡'''Así''' se hace! Lo hiciste genial.|Way to go! You did great.|lit='''That's how''' it's done!}}
#: {{ux|es|[[así es la vida|'''Así''' es la vida]].|inline=1|[[such is life|'''Such''' is life]].}}
#: {{ux|es|Si no paras de hablar '''así''', vas a hacerme llorar.|If you don't stop talking '''like that''', you're going to make me cry.}}
# {{lb|es|followed by a subjunctive clause}} {{n-g|Used to express wishes of misfortune against someone, or to cast a spell}}
#: {{ux|es|¡'''Así''' reciba un dolor de cabeza!|'''Even if''' he gets a headache!}}

